         (smtfp_bits 1w 15w 4w : (3,5) smtfp) : word8) = 254w``),
     ("to signed BV RNA", ``(smtfp_to_sbv RNA
         (smtfp_bits 1w 15w 4w : (3,5) smtfp) : word8) = 254w``),
     ("to signed BV RTP", ``(smtfp_to_sbv RTP
